  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a subsidy for the premium on the loan portfolio guarantee to  Madison Finance. The LPG is meant to stimulate financial              institutions&apos; appetite for lending primarily to small scale renewable energy equipment and will complement the biogas project by SNV. The   guarantee is being confinanced with USAID on a 50-50 basis. This      contribution is linked to the main contribution PLUS 54020179</narrative>
